'''Gone with the Wind''' was a passive event that could happen in the {{zone|Dwarven Mines}} and the {{zone|Crystal Hollows}}. 

== Mechanics ==
The '''Gone with the Wind''' event lasted for 15 minutes. Looking in the right direction of the 'wind' rewards the player with a {{stat|mining speed}} bonus.

